inary β-hCG (unavailable result) to assess for pregnancy-related complications"], "excluded_candidates": ["Appendicitis: pain typically localises to right lower quadrant, less consistent with RUQ presentation", "Musculoskeletal strain: could explain pain exacerbation with exercise but insufficient to explain haemodynamic instability", "Alcohol-related hepatitis: plausible given daily alcohol use but would more likely present with chronic liver disease features", "Budd-Chiari syndrome: chronic progression more typical than acute presentation", "Acute pancreatitis: less likely to present with isolated RUQ pain and focal tenderness"], "alarm_features": ["Hypotension", "Tachycardia", "Severe localised right upper quadrant pain"]}, "branches": {"B1": {"id": "B1", "label": "Gynecologic / Pelvic Pathology", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "expanded", "prior": 0.4285714285714286, "posterior": 0.5477862530927928, "danger": 0.8, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": [], "evidence_against": [], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": [], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 1.0, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.75, "interrupt_relevance": 0.9, "level_role": "family", "classification_axis": "anatomy", "representative_diseases": []}, "B2": {"id": "B2", "label": "Hepatic / Hepatobiliary Vascular Pathology", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "expanded", "prior": 0.0, "posterior": 0.0759231746786611, "danger": 0.8, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.5, "evidence_for": [], "evidence_against": [], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": ["B2.1", "B2.2", "B2.3"], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 1.5, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.65, "interrupt_relevance": 0.8, "level_role": "family", "classification_axis": "anatomy", "representative_diseases": []}, "B3": {"id": "B3", "label": "Biliary Obstruction / Choledocholithiasis", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "expanded"